    [EXECUTED Box Pigeon]                      [VALUE Box Pigeon]                       [MAGNITUDE Box Pigeon]             [SCALED Box Pigeon]
    [LOAD Box Pigeon]                          [OF Box Pigeon]                          [BULLSHIT Box Pigeon]              [PROPAGANDA Box Pigeon]
